@startuml Sequence_Reservation_Complete
!theme plain
autonumber
actor "Client (Angular UI)" as Client
participant "API Gateway\n:8080" as Gateway
participant "Vehicle Service\n:8082" as VehicleSrv
participant "Reservation Service\n:8083" as ResSrv
participant "Payment Service\n:8084" as PaySrv
queue "RabbitMQ\nBroker" as Broker

title Parcours Complet d'une Réservation de Voiture (CarRental)

== 1. Recherche & Consultation ==
Client -> Gateway : GET /api/vehicles/search?agencyId=1&category=SUV&start=2026-11-10&end=2026-11-15
Gateway -> VehicleSrv : GET /api/vehicles/search
VehicleSrv --> Gateway : 200 OK (Liste de véhicules disponibles + tarifs)
Gateway --> Client : 200 OK (Affichage du catalogue filtré)

== 2. Sélection et Vérification de Disponibilité ==
Client -> Gateway : GET /api/vehicles/5/availability
Gateway -> VehicleSrv : GET /api/vehicles/5/availability
VehicleSrv --> Gateway : 200 OK {available: true, pricePerDay: 45.00}
Gateway --> Client : 200 OK {available: true}

== 3. Création de la Réservation (Statut PENDING) ==
Client -> Gateway : POST /api/reservations (JWT Bearer Token)\n{vehicleId: 5, start: 2026-11-10, end: 2026-11-15, paymentMethod: "CREDIT_CARD"}
Gateway -> ResSrv : POST /api/reservations (Header X-User-Id)

group Appel Synchrone Inter-Service (OpenFeign)
    ResSrv -> VehicleSrv : GET /api/vehicles/5 (Vérifier existence & tarif)
    VehicleSrv --> ResSrv : 200 OK {pricePerDay: 45.00, status: AVAILABLE}
end

note over ResSrv : Calcul : 5 jours * 45€ = 225.00€\nCréation Réservation (Statut: PENDING)
ResSrv -> ResSrv : Enregistrement en base reservation_db

== 4. Traitement du Paiement ==
group Appel Synchrone vers Payment Service (OpenFeign)
    ResSrv -> PaySrv : POST /api/payments/process\n{reservationId: 101, userId: 12, amount: 225.00, method: "CREDIT_CARD"}
    note over PaySrv : Simulation bancaire validée\nGénération facture #INV-2026-101\nStatut: PAID
    PaySrv --> ResSrv : 201 Created {paymentId: 501, status: "PAID", transactionId: "TX-77892"}
end

== 5. Mise à jour du Statut & Publication Asynchrone ==
note over ResSrv : Mise à jour Réservation -> CONFIRMED
ResSrv -> ResSrv : Enregistrement en base reservation_db

ResSrv -> Broker : Publication événement "reservation.confirmed"\n{reservationId: 101, vehicleId: 5, dates: [...]}

Broker -> VehicleSrv : Consommation événement "reservation.confirmed"
note over VehicleSrv : Mise à jour véhicule #5 -> RENTED (sur cette période)

== 6. Réponse et Confirmation au Client ==
ResSrv --> Gateway : 201 Created {id: 101, status: "CONFIRMED", totalPrice: 225.00}
Gateway --> Client : 201 Created + Récapitulatif & Facture téléchargeable

@enduml
